  ],
  "slug": "my-bicycle",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/21141_my-bicycle.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My favorite car is a bicycle. When I was six years old, my mother bought me a small bicycle. That car is very beautiful, as blue as the sky. Although the car is small, I can ride it very fast.",
    "I often ride my bike to the park or library, through streets and bridges, and across the city. Bikes are my best friends."
  ],
  "english_full": "My favorite car is a bicycle. When I was six years old, my mother bought me a small bicycle. That car is very beautiful, as blue as the sky. Although the car is small, I can ride it very fast.\n\nI often ride my bike to the park or library, through streets and bridges, and across the city. Bikes are my best friends.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Моя предпочита́емая маши́на — это велоси́пед. Когда́ мне было шесть лет, ма́ма купи́ла мне ма́ленький велоси́пед. Эта маши́на очень краси́вая, синяя, как не́бо. Хо́тя машинка ма́ленькая, я могу́ е́зжать на ней очень быстро.",
    "Я ча́сто ката́юсь на своём велоси́педе в парк или библиоте́ку, по улицам и мо́стам, и че́рез го́род. Велоси́педы — мои лу́чшие друзья́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Moya predpochtáemaya mashiná — éto vélosipéd. Kogdá mne bílo shés tlet, máma kupíla mné mál'en'kiy vélosipéd. Éta mashiná óchen' krasívaya, sín'yaya, kak nébo. Hót'ya mashínka mál'en'kaya, ya mogú yézhat' na néy óchen' bystro.",
    "Ya chásto katáyus' na svoém vélosipéde v park ili bibliotékú, po ulítsam i móstam, i chéréz górod. Vélosipédy — moi lútshíye druz'ya."
  ],
